{"name":"SMACCs.accQuad_ext","v":1,"source_hash":"f0ae6fc8484ccd77","lines":["n : ℕ","S T : (SMCharges n).Charges","h : ∀ (j : Fin 5), ∑ i, ((fun a => a ^ 2) ∘ (toSpecies j) S) i = ∑ i, ((fun a => a ^ 2) ∘ (toSpecies j) T) i","⊢ accQuad S = accQuad T","⊢ (quadBiLin S) S = (quadBiLin T) T","⊢ ∑ x, (Q S x * Q S x + -2 * (U S x * U S x) + D S x * D S x + -1 * (L S x * L S x) + E S x * E S x) =","    ∑ x, (Q T x * Q T x + -2 * (U T x * U T x) + D T x * D T x + -1 * (L T x * L T x) + E T x * E T x)","⊢ ∑ x, Q S x * Q S x + ∑ x, -2 * (U S x * U S x) + ∑ x, D S x * D S x + ∑ x, -1 * (L S x * L S x) + ∑ x, E S x * E S x =","    ∑ x, Q T x * Q T x + ∑ x, -2 * (U T x * U T x) + ∑ x, D T x * D T x + ∑ x, -1 * (L T x * L T x) + ∑ x, E T x * E T x","⊢ ∑ x, (Q S x * Q S x + -2 * (U S x * U S x) + D S x * D S x + -1 * (L S x * L S x)) + ∑ x, E S x * E S x =","⊢ ∑ x, Q S x * Q S x + -2 * ∑ i, U S i * U S i + ∑ x, D S x * D S x + -1 * ∑ i, L S i * L S i + ∑ x, E S x * E S x =","    ∑ x, Q T x * Q T x + -2 * ∑ i, U T i * U T i + ∑ x, D T x * D T x + -1 * ∑ i, L T i * L T i + ∑ x, E T x * E T x","⊢ ∑ x, Q S x * Q S x + -2 * ∑ i, U S i * U S i + ∑ x, D S x * D S x + ∑ x, -1 * (L S x * L S x) + ∑ x, E S x * E S x =","⊢ ∑ x, Q S x ^ 2 - (∑ x, U S x ^ 2) * 2 + ∑ x, D S x ^ 2 - ∑ x, L S x ^ 2 + ∑ x, E S x ^ 2 =","    ∑ x, Q T x ^ 2 - (∑ x, U T x ^ 2) * 2 + ∑ x, D T x ^ 2 - ∑ x, L T x ^ 2 + ∑ x, E T x ^ 2"],"goals":[[0,1,2,3],[0,1,2,4],[0,1,2,5,6],[0,1,2,7,8],[0,1,2,9,6],[0,1,2,10,11],[0,1,2,12,8],[0,1,2,13,14]],"steps":[{"line":14,"col":2,"end_line":14,"end_col":81,"tactic":"simp only [HomogeneousQuadratic, accQuad, BiLinearSymm.toHomogeneousQuad_apply]","before":[0],"after":[1],"used":["Rat.addCommMonoid","BiLinearSymm.toHomogeneousQuad_apply","Eq.mpr","ACCSystemCharges.Charges","Semiring.toModule","SMCharges","congrArg","Rat","LinearMap.instFunLike","ACCSystemCharges.chargesModule","id","LinearMap","BiLinearSymm","HomogeneousQuadratic.instFun","congr","ACCSystemCharges.chargesAddCommMono